shortdesc OpenType maths fonts for Latin Modern
longdesc Latin Modern Math is a maths companion for the Latin Modern
longdesc family of fonts, in OpenType format. For use with LuaLaTeX or
longdesc XeLaTeX, support is available from the unicode-math package.
